  "ingredients": [
    "8 large tart apples",
    "8 wooden chopsticks for handles",
    "2 cups packed brown sugar",
    "1 (14 ounce) can sweetened condensed milk",
    "1 cup light corn syrup",
    "1 cup butter",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a large saucepan of water to a boil. Dip apples in water for a few seconds with a slotted spoon to remove any wax from skins; dry with paper towels. Let cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XhbRGtcvh8-SA20-P5Q_zYMmdMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-01b-bce1aa8a02284a06887b293bafaeeef3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Insert sticks through bottom core of each apple.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6gb9nHDkP0oSp9UHSIMIxIyZgUk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-02-8d648a72f57444ae8010d9f7129ff62d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. Stir brown sugar, sweetened condensed milk, corn syrup, and butter together in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EmPcSLT_r4aAo6dpXuqg0TC8LJM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-03-5ffe7a05b8d841a59e68bd1a6aa985b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil, stirring constantly; reduce heat to medium. Cook until a candy thermometer reads 248 degrees F (120 degrees C), stirring constantly to prevent burning, 25 to 30 minutes. A teaspoon of caramel dropped in a glass of cold water should form a firm ball.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NYJFSiTqXmTBxcZj9Ji9kIXuAwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-04-ab1a6cb513a94b59b21bcab2e99f906f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat; stir in vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4FfIlYfyIjgTsE0QnftwRBqN4fM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-05-bc1faee2a6cc41df9ef1c72f7286caa3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working quickly, dip each apple into caramel to completely coat apple and about 1/2 inch of the handle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x1lp0i07Qs9eEEfZashbRaNvHWk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-06-fb3267d3c20448a2ad91f5b819f75f80.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle apples with desired toppings while still hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IwwubeHAjrpRq1B3BDtsESOMvsI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-step-07-0f5f6cbabe3e4688b66932cdf1ec91b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool on the prepared baking sheet, about 1 hour. Use caution, caramel is very hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4rT6omozSIwJlO_9JFJgvvxbNO4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-228210-the-best-caramel-apples-DDMFS-4x3-3bbc584f3fa943f385bd8e4b818be428.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228210/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
